  sorry: I can't negate an equality check: ask "is A equal to B" and invert the yes/no answer
> is x^2 unequal to x^2 + 1?
  sorry: I can't negate an equality check: ask "is A equal to B" and invert the yes/no answer
> is x^2 identical to x^2?
  ucas: it(x) = x^2
  ucas: that(x) = x^2
  ucas: equiv it that
it and that are equal on the domain of it (proved by algebra: f - g simplifies to 0 over Q)
